New in this Release
-------------------

This is the first alpha release for the phyCORE-AM6Px. The following interfaces are currently working:

* SD-Card
* eMMC
* SPI-Flash
* RTC
* EEPROM
* I2C
* RS232
* CAN FD
* Ethernet

